---
description: Enforce strict TypeScript conventions, explicit return types on public exports, and zero implicit any across monorepo packages. Use when editing .ts or .tsx files.
globs: "**/*.ts,**/*.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript Strict Style

- Never silence compiler errors with `@ts-ignore` or bare `as any`.
- Prefer discriminated unions over optional boolean flag combinations.
- Keep public package APIs typed and documented in `src/types.ts`.
